            "anchor": "terms-prices",
            "body": "<p>Product prices are shown on the website at the time you place your order. Any delivery charge will be shown before you complete checkout.</p><p>We take reasonable care to make sure prices are correct. If an obvious pricing error occurs, we may contact you to correct it before the order is fulfilled.</p><p>Payment must be made using one of the payment methods made available at checkout.</p>"
