            "nav_label": "Products",
            "anchor": "terms-products",
            "body": "<p>We aim to describe and photograph products as accurately as reasonably possible. Colours and appearance may vary slightly depending on your screen and from batch to batch where natural ingredients are used.</p><p>All products are subject to availability. We may withdraw or change products from time to time.</p><p>Please read product labels, ingredient lists and usage instructions before use. Stop using a product if irritation occurs.</p>"
