            "body": "<p>We deliver to the locations shown at checkout. UK delivery is free on every order.</p><p>Any estimated dispatch or delivery times are provided in good faith. Where the law requires a specific delivery timeframe, your statutory rights continue to apply.</p><p>If a parcel is delayed, lost or arrives damaged, please contact us with your order number so we can investigate.</p><p>More information is available on our <a href=\"/pages/delivery-returns\">Delivery &amp; Returns page</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
