          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cancellations & returns",
            "nav_label": "Cancellations & returns",
            "anchor": "terms-returns",
            "body": "<p><strong>Unwanted items (change of mind).</strong> Under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013, you have the right to cancel your online order within 14 days of receiving your goods, and a further 14 days to return them to us for a refund.</p><p><strong>Hygiene exemption.</strong> Please note that for health protection and hygiene reasons, we cannot accept returns or offer refunds on any cosmetic products where the tamper-evident hygiene seal has been broken, removed, or tampered with after delivery. To be eligible for a return due to a change of mind, items must be unused, in their original packaging, and have all hygiene seals completely intact.</p><p><strong>Return shipping costs.</strong> If you are returning an unwanted, sealed item, you are responsible for paying the return postage costs. We recommend using a tracked delivery service, as we cannot be held responsible for items lost in transit.</p><p>Our full Returns &amp; Refunds Policy is on our <a href=\"/pages/delivery-returns\">Delivery &amp; Returns page</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
