            "nav_label": "Faulty goods",
            "anchor": "terms-faulty",
            "body": "<p>This policy does not affect your statutory rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015. If your product arrives damaged, faulty, or is not as described, please contact us immediately. You are entitled to a replacement for faulty items, we ask that you provide us with proof of images sent to our email address original@originalskinn.com prior to us sending out a replacement.</p>"
