            "body": "<p>Promotional codes, offers and discounts may have their own conditions, expiry dates or product exclusions. Unless stated otherwise, only one promotional code may be used per order.</p><p>We may withdraw or amend a promotion where reasonably necessary, provided this does not affect orders already accepted.</p>"
