            "nav_label": "Website use",
            "anchor": "terms-website",
            "body": "<p>The website and its content, including branding, text, graphics, photographs and design, may be protected by intellectual property rights.</p><p>You may use the website for personal shopping and information purposes. You must not reproduce, copy or commercially exploit website content without permission where rights apply.</p><p>You must not misuse the website, attempt unauthorised access, introduce malicious code or interfere with its normal operation.</p>"
